    {
      "entry": 12997,
      "name": "Monty",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:12997:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:ab51c115fcc3b263dc588415",
            "source:d454f4a8b940d7347b057603",
            "source:f2961d29e5ec6223a2a72aa8",
            "source:3920e87c478a275d8d9f3aed",
            "source:3c80ccf3342fe1d378f5074d",
            "source:111d0a9591377033e9e66d9a",
            "source:d691c3fa1169c4bacbf569f1",
            "source:075a742a54282a010f60f66c"
          ],
          "text": "Monty is a rat extermination specialist who urges people to help with the Deeprun Tram’s rat problem and capture the rats alive. He calls himself a pirate and speaks in pirate slang. In his account, his brother Nipsy runs a rat kabob operation and needs live rats; Monty’s own remarks also emphasize keeping the tram clean and making room while he handles the rats.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 12997
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": "Rat Extermination Specialist"
    },
    {
      "entry": 13016,
      "name": "Deeprun Rat",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:13016:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:af688964bd9f2b2e2e3355ec",
            "source:47c32c587d3621841c72966f"
          ],
          "text": "A small Deeprun rat that can follow the player when a spell hits it.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 13016
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "entry": 13017,
      "name": "Enthralled Deeprun Rat",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:13017:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:69d7f81c91b8857d51fd5ad8",
            "source:425c0694d0aa696507d2b07a"
          ],
          "text": "An enthralled Deeprun rat counted among the creatures to capture alive for Monty's roundup, using a flute to lead five rats back alive.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 13017
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "entry": 13018,
      "name": "Nipsy",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:13018:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:f06429db997893d672a1b438",
            "source:9bf043e83af80ce75f6ffb03",
            "source:dc2f8a6bc05a82e6b13163c4"
          ],
          "text": "Nipsy runs a rat-kabob operation and is Monty's brother. When a crate of rats arrives, he checks that they are still alive. He sighs that Monty has never seen an ocean despite acting like a pirate, and has not been the same since Gnomeregan.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 13018
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "entry": 14041,
      "name": "Haggle",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:14041:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:941cc8d0a1b7d1212a03e0a1",
            "source:17fd0250dfcb95a22cbe579b",
            "source:0e0843669dc9d013291188e0",
            "source:22ad4287dfca3a7712861ac4",
            "source:69f075b6d442cc3e5d61f185"
          ],
          "text": "Haggle hawks rat-kabobs and begs for change. His scattered talk moves from losing everything and his mind to cheese, an unexplained 'forty-two,' and the rats he sees everywhere. His words suggest a troubled, confused figure whose attention keeps returning to the rats around him.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 14041
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": null
    },
    {
